<v Narrator>Na biyu, karatun rubutun tsari mai tsawo ya ɗauki fiye da sau dubu biyu fiye da ƙarfin chip fiye da karantawa na ƙididdiga masu ƙanƙanta.

3
00:00:21.764 --> 00:00:32.390
<v Narrator>Na uku, yankan rubutun da aka gina zuwa ga AI kalmomin ɓangaren ya kashe sau biyu fiye da ƙarfin lantarki fiye da parsing the text itself.
